      "text": "**Defining Fintech Solution**\n\nI'm focusing on defining Plaid Nexus as a fintech solution. I'm explaining its purpose, built-in features, and emphasizing *why* it fits this category. I'm aiming to showcase the value proposition for the dashboard and the problem it aims to solve. This focuses on providing a framework to solve some of the most pressing needs of users.\n\n\n**Refining Feature Set**\n\nI'm now refining the core functionality, focusing on features like Plaid Link integration, token management, real-time data sync, and a CORS proxy. The visual style is taking shape with a cyber-security aesthetic, JetBrains Mono font, and professional icons, and a \"Developer Workbench\" or \"Fintech Ops Terminal\". I'm highlighting the value of the real-time Traffic Log for fintech reliability. I'm focusing on the name, one-liner, feature list, and \"Fintech\" justification.\n\n\n",
