              "replacement": "\n# ⚡ Nexus Terminal: The Unified Fintech Ops Engine\n\n**Nexus Terminal** is a professional-grade developer workbench that merges open-banking data aggregation with modern card issuing capabilities. Built in a high-intensity sprint, it bridges **Plaid** (PolkaID) and **Marqeta** into a single, cohesive command center.\n\n## 🚀 Capabilities\n1.  **Banking Aggregation (Plaid)**: Complete flow for link token generation, KYC verification, and transaction sync.\n2.  **Card Issuance (Marqeta)**: Fully automated card product deployment, user registration, and virtual card minting via the Marqeta Sandbox API.\n3.  **Real-time Ledgering**: Unified dashboard visualizing institutional bank accounts alongside newly issued digital assets.\n4.  **Packet Interceptor**: Live system traffic log for sub-millisecond protocol debugging across multiple API nodes.\n5.  **Secure Tunneling**: Native CORS proxy integration for seamless client-side rapid prototyping.\n\n## 💎 The Fintech Edge\n*   **One-Click Issuance**: Automates the multi-step Marqeta process (Product -> User -> Card) into a single \"Mint\" action.\n*   **High-Fidelity UI**: Uses glassmorphism and carbon-fiber design patterns to deliver a premium \"Wall Street Terminal\" experience.\n*   **Zero-Persistence**: Architected for maximum security, ensuring that sensitive access tokens exist only within the volatile memory of the current session.\n\n## ⏱️ Development Stats\n- **Total Build Time**: ~180 Minutes\n- **Integrations**: Plaid SDK V2, Marqeta V3 REST (Basic Auth)\n- **Frontend**: React 19 + Tailwind + Lucide\n\n---\n*Nexus Engineering Protocol — Verified.*\n"
